### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or the JetBrains HTTP client.
@base = http://localhost:5080
@key = demo-api-key-2026

### Status
GET {{base}}/api/v1/status
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### Items (paged); filters: q, type (book|music|toy), categoryId, branch (code), availableOnly, page, pageSize
GET {{base}}/api/v1/items?q=dune&type=book&availableOnly=true
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### One item by library code
GET {{base}}/api/v1/items/BK-001
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### Categories
GET {{base}}/api/v1/categories
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### Branches and opening hours
GET {{base}}/api/v1/branches
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### Branch by code
GET {{base}}/api/v1/branches/CENTRAL
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### OpenAPI description (no key needed)
GET {{base}}/api/openapi.json

### Expect 401 (no key)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/items

### Expect 405 (read-only API)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/items
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
